# macOS Finder junk — never commit.
.DS_Store

# Local-only: the retired dotfile commit-message names. Kept here so an old habit
# cannot accidentally commit one. The current name is COMMIT-MESSAGE.txt, below.
.claude-commit-msg.txt
.claude-commit-msg-*.txt

# The commit summary for the build you are about to push. NOT a dotfile on purpose:
# a leading dot makes macOS Finder hide it, and gitignoring it hides it from GitHub
# Desktop too — which made it invisible in both places at once. This name is visible
# in Finder and still never committed.
COMMIT-MESSAGE.txt

# The desktop app copies every file it sends to the outputs column into this folder.
# It is never part of the project (moved to _to_delete/ at every session close).
Claude outputs/
